          Our vision is to explore possibilities, solve
          real-world problems and create digital products
          that make a difference.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-box">
        <h3>Our Philosophy.</h3>
        <p>
          Think beyond boundaries. Create with purpose.
          Develop with precision. Every idea is an opportunity
          to build something extraordinary.
          <br><br>
          We are building ORVIX with a long-term vision
          of innovation, creativity and excellence.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SERVICES -->

<section id="services">
  <div class="container">

    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="section-tag">02 / WHAT WE DO</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">
        Technology designed for progress.
      </h2>
      <p class="section-desc">
        Exploring modern technologies to develop solutions
        for tomorrow's digital world.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="services-grid">

      <div class="service-card reveal">
        <div class="service-icon">✳</div>
        <h3>AI & Automation</h3>
        <p>
          Intelligent workflows, AI-powered tools,
          chatbots and automation concepts.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card reveal">
        <div class="service-icon">⌘</div>
        <h3>Web Development</h3>
        <p>
          Modern, responsive websites and digital
