        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card reveal">
        <div class="service-icon">◈</div>
        <h3>Software Solutions</h3>
        <p>
          Exploring practical software products
          and tools to solve everyday challenges.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card reveal">
        <div class="service-icon">◎</div>
        <h3>UI/UX Design</h3>
        <p>
          Clean interfaces, thoughtful experiences
          and user-focused digital design.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card reveal">
        <div class="service-icon">⌘</div>
        <h3>Digital Strategy</h3>
        <p>
          Digital planning, brand presence
          and technology-focused ideas.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card reveal">
        <div class="service-icon">↗</div>
        <h3>Future Innovation</h3>
        <p>
          Researching emerging technologies
          and exploring new digital possibilities.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PORTFOLIO -->

<section class="portfolio" id="portfolio">
  <div class="container">

    <div class="portfolio-heading reveal">
      <div>
        <div class="section-tag">03 / SELECTED WORK</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">
          Ideas worth exploring.
        </h2>
        <p class="section-desc">
          A space for our digital experiments,
          creative concepts and projects.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="project-grid">

      <article class="project reveal">
        <div class="project-art blue-art">
          <div class="art-circle">AI</div>
        </div>
        <div class="project-info">
          <span class="project-type">AI / TECHNOLOGY</span>
          <h3>Intelligent Systems</h3>
          <p>
            Exploring the potential of intelligent
