          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="project reveal">
        <div class="project-art light-art">
          <div class="art-text" style="color:#101827">
            DIGITAL.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="project-info">
          <span class="project-type">WEB / DEVELOPMENT</span>
          <h3>Digital Experiences</h3>
          <p>
            Modern web concepts focused on usability,
            performance and visual quality.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="project reveal">
        <div class="project-art black-art">
          <div class="art-text" style="color:white">
            ORVIX
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="project-info">
          <span class="project-type">BRANDING / DESIGN</span>
          <h3>Brand Identity</h3>
          <p>
            Building a distinctive visual identity
            for a technology-focused brand.
